('Ipswich River Nature Camp', 'Mass Audubon', 'https://www.massaudubon.org/places-to-explore/wildlife-sanctuaries/ipswich-river/camp', 'https://www.massaudubon.org/programs?prg%5Bpid%5D%5B%5D=17529&prg%5Bdaterange%5D=&prg%5Bquery%5D=&prg%5Bprogram_types%5D%5B%5D=849&prg%5Binclude_camps%5D=1&prg%5Bsubmit%5D=&prg%5Bage_min%5D=&prg%5Bage_max%5D=', 'ipswichrivercamp@massaudubon.org', '978-252-0204', '87 Perkins Row', 'Topsfield', 'MA', '01983', 'Boston, MA', 'day', ARRAY['nature','outdoor']::text[], ARRAY['STEM','arts','leadership']::text[], ARRAY['hiking','canoeing','vernal pool monitoring','crafts','games','nature photography','art']::text[], NULL, 5, 14, NULL, NULL, 'Weekly nature camp at Mass Audubon''s Ipswich River sanctuary in Topsfield; campers hike, catch and identify small animals, and older groups paddle canoes to Perkins Island, with art, photography, and teen leadership weeks.', 'outdoor', NULL, 114, 570, NULL, 'week', TRUE, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, 'Nonrefundable deposit at registration; full refund minus the deposit through May 1, no refunds after May 1 or for absences/dismissal.', NULL, NULL, TRUE, 'https://www.massaudubon.org/places-to-explore/wildlife-sanctuaries/ipswich-river/camp/about-camp', 2026, '[{"name": "Extended care (afternoon)", "amount": 85, "per": "week", "required": false, "note": "3:00 to 4:00 pm."}]'::jsonb, '483a8414-90aa-5e98-ad82-0ef89874af75', 'mass-audubon-ipswich-river-nature-camp', ST_GeogFromText('SRID=4326;POINT(-70.9495 42.6376)'), TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, 'unverified', ARRAY['https://www.massaudubon.org/places-to-explore/wildlife-sanctuaries/ipswich-river','https://www.massaudubon.org/places-to-explore/wildlife-sanctuaries/ipswich-river/camp','https://www.massaudubon.org/places-to-explore/wildlife-sanctuaries/ipswich-river/camp/about-camp','https://www.massaudubon.org/places-to-explore/wildlife-sanctuaries/ipswich-river/camp/programs-pricing','https://www.massaudubon.org/programs-events/nature-camps/camp-polic