('b83ad80f-cea5-5304-bad3-962937ad66c7', 'operator_name', 'public_web', 'https://www.dextersouthfield.org/summer/camp/info', '2026-11-13', 'Updated to the 2027 season by Claude from this page on 2026-11-13; needs a person''s check. 2027 fee table: SciTech Camp (ages 8-12) $895 per week, Weeks 1-7; Early Drop-Off $20/day, After Camp (3:30-5:30pm) $42/day, Bus service $200 (non-refundable $50/week bus deposit). Non-refundable $250 deposit per week or session; final payment due May 1; partial refunds less deposits until June 1. No camp Friday June 18 or the week of July 5-9. Transportation now sourced here: the old transportation page returns 404.'),
