('3c401296-fc1d-5f07-8d32-7f14e06eb208', 'name', 'public_web', 'https://www.jewishallianceri.org/explore-programs/for-children/summer-j-camp', '2026-10-02', 'Ages derived from grades K-6. Prices are non-member weekly rates (members $356; $286 for 4-day Week 2); registration fee $75 non-member. Early care 8:00-8:45 ($12.50/day), extended care 4:00-5:30 ($25/day). Lunch provided. Address is the Dwares JCC address in the page''s structured data; camp arrival is at the Session St. playground. Week 2 has no camp July 3.'),
